             ↓
          Resume BAU
Error Handling
If reconciliation fails:
Do not apply final constraints.
Do not mark migration complete.
Do not resume BAU.
Record reconciliation failures.
Provide a reconciliation report for investigation.
Acceptance Criteria
[ ] Migration counts are reconciled.
[ ] MAIN data is verified.
[ ] Audit count is reconciled.
[ ] Outbox count is reconciled.
